        "TileImage": "$($repository a352b5a8-a74b-46bc-b879-46ffba6614a2).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. Today, we have a challenge for you. We have uncovered three PROVIDENCE members and have tracked them down in a rather public location. They are about to take a flight out of the USA so this is our last chance to nail them. Bad news is, this neighborhood is a key hub of activaty for the ICA. We do not wish for any alarms or anything that can cause police response. Try to keep damage minimal. The ICA is counting on you. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
